# CHAROS changelog

## Unreleased

- Prepare TC-Nest for NixOS 26.05 by replacing removed `neofetch` with the
  maintained `fastfetch` system-information tool.
- Begin the required durable build and change records for future maintenance.
- Move Node.js from 22 to 24 and remove system-wide heavyweight ML libraries;
  keep lightweight audio and web-service Python dependencies in the base OS.
- Keep project code and history while moving heavyweight model dependencies
  out of the host system closure and into isolated, lesson-specific runtimes.
- Reframe TC-Nest documentation around its September 2026 learning-machine
  role and label former resident accounts as migration history to preserve.
- Add a dated storage inventory separating identity, dirty work, and live
  service state from roughly 12 GiB of conservative cleanup candidates.
